    "title": "Pike Co. man arrested on drug trafficking, possession charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Sizemore ,\n5 hours ago PIKE COUNTY, Ky. (WYMT) - A Pikeville man is facing multiple drug-related charges, including trafficking meth, following an arrest in downtown Pikeville. State Police arrested William Cody West, 45, on Monday at approximately 11:00 p.m. near Hambley Boulevard. A state trooper reported trying to locate West in the downtown area. Read full article\n1",
